# Build output for the fuzz package (its own workspace, so its own target dir).
/target

# libFuzzer's working corpus: machine-local, grows without bound, and is
# regenerated from `seeds/` on any machine. Committed seeds live in `seeds/`.
/corpus

# Coverage data from `cargo fuzz coverage`.
/coverage

# NOTE: `artifacts/` is deliberately NOT ignored. A crash reproducer that
# libFuzzer drops there is the whole payoff of a fuzzing run — commit it, and
# `tests/corpus_replay.rs` re-checks the fix on every push from then on.
